.com/users/andrewlewis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2015-09-16T11:33:04Z","updated_at":"2015-09-16T11:33:04Z","body":"The UI on this device is probably rendered at 1080p, but SurfaceView surfaces can show full 4K resolution. Display.getRealSize is reporting the lower UI resolution so the stream is getting filtered out.\n\nAs per https://developer.android.com/preview/api-overview.html#4K-display we need to use Display.Mode which was added in API 23. For earlier platform versions we would need to find out the real resolution in some other way or implement a workaround.\n","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/140713678/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"andrewlewis","id":107897,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNzg5Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107897?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis","html_url":"https://github.com/andrewlewis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":410852789,"node_id":"MDEyOkxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDQxMDg1Mjc4OQ==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos